#: easy_driver/classes.py:204
msgid "Smooth ease-in/ease-out (smoothstep) mapping, clamped to the target range. Starts and ends gently with more motion in the middle - good for organic movement like blinks, ear flops, or any shape key that should feel less mechanical than a straight line"
msgstr "平滑缓入/缓出（smoothstep）映射，并钳制在目标范围内。两端平缓、中间变化更多——适合眨眼、耳朵摆动等有机运动，或任何应比直线更自然的形态键"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:217
msgid "Snaps straight to Min or Max at the halfway point of the source range - no in-between values. Good for toggle-style behavior driven by a continuous source, like a pose-space switch or an on/off visual cue"
msgstr "在源范围的中点直接跳到最小或最大值——没有中间值。适合由连续源驱动的切换式行为，例如姿态空间开关或开/关视觉提示"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:185
#: easy_driver/classes.py:5430
msgid "Source"
msgstr "源"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:4872
msgid "Source configuration cleared"
msgstr "源配置已清除"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:5448
msgid "Source slot updated"
msgstr "源槽位已更新"

#: easy_driver/core_functions.py:1674
msgid "Starboard_"
msgstr "右舷_"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:213
msgid "Starts fast, settles gently at the end. Good for motion that should feel like it's coming to rest - landing a pose, a blink closing, anything that shouldn't feel like it's slamming into its end value"
msgstr "开始快、末端平缓收住。适合应显得逐渐静止的运动——落定姿势、闭眼，或任何不应猛冲到结束值的动作"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:209
msgid "Starts slow, accelerates toward the end. Good for things that should feel like they're building up momentum - a wind-up before a snap, or motion that starts hesitant and commits harder as it goes"
msgstr "开始慢、朝末端加速。适合应显得蓄积动量的情况——快速动作前的蓄势，或起初犹豫、随后越来越坚决的运动"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:217
msgid "Step"
msgstr "阶跃"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:232
msgid "Straight-line mapping that is NOT clamped - keeps extrapolating past Min/Max instead of flattening out. Use when the target should keep scaling/moving even if the source goes further than the recorded range (no ceiling or floor)"
msgstr "不做钳制的直线映射——超出最小/最大值后继续外推，而不是变平。当源超出记录范围时目标仍应继续缩放/移动时使用（无上限或下限）"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:200
msgid "Straight-line mapping, clamped to the target range. The default - constant rate of change from Min to Max. Use this unless you specifically need easing, looping, or extrapolation"
msgstr "直线映射，并钳制在目标范围内。默认选项——从最小到最大以恒定速率变化。除非特别需要缓动、循环或外推，否则使用此项"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:259
msgid "Subtract"
msgstr "相减"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:259
msgid "Subtract each later source from the first, in order"
msgstr "按顺序用第一个源减去后续每个源"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:257
msgid "Sum all sources together"
msgstr "将所有源相加"

#: easy_driver/classes.py:455
